<title>CANADA: Bell Canada to redeem Series 8 preferreds.</title>
<headline>Bell Canada to redeem Series 8 preferreds.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCE Inc unit Bell Canada said on Monday that it plans to redeem on December 1 all of its $1.94 Cumulative Redeemable Retractable class A preferred shares Series 8 at C$26 a share.</p>
<p>A formal notice of redemption will be mailed to all registered holders of Series 8 preferred shares.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend of C$0.485 a share due on December 1, 1996 will be paid in the usual manner to shareholders of record on November 1, l996, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
